creatures:
- name: Xorn
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 19  
      **Hit Points** 84 (rollable(dice=8d8 + 48,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Burrow 20 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Initiative) (10)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=17)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+3,label=+3,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=22)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=11)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+0,label=+0,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Perception Check), Stealth rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=Stealth Check)  
      **Damage Immunities** poison  
      **Condition Immunities** paralyzed, petrified, poisoned  
      **Senses** darkvision 60 ft., tremorsense 60 ft., Passive Perception 16  
      **Languages** Primordial (Terran)  
      **Challenge** 5 (1,800 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +3  

      ## Traits

      ***Earth Glide.*** The xorn can burrow through nonmagical, unworked earth and stone. While doing so, the xorn doesn't disturb the material it moves through.

      ***Treasure Sense.*** The xorn can pinpoint the location of precious metals and stones within 60 feet of itself.

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The xorn makes one Bite attack and three Claw attacks.

      ***Bite.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Bite]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d6+3,dicelabel=Damage [Bite]) Piercing damage.

      ***Claw.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+6,label=+6,dicelabel=To Hit [Claw]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=1d10+3,dicelabel=Damage [Claw]) Slashing damage.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Charge.*** The xorn moves up to its ***Speed*** or ***Burrow Speed*** straight toward an enemy it can sense.

